---
import { Badge, Button, Card, DeviceFrame, Icon, Image, Stack, Typography } from '@santi020k/lumen-astro'
---

<Typography><Stack gap="lg">
  <div class="device-demo-caption"><h3>MacBook Pro</h3><span>Graphite · live iframe</span></div>
  <div class="device-demo-stage device-demo-stage--computer">
    <DeviceFrame device="macbook-pro">
      <iframe loading="lazy" sandbox="" src="/device-frame-demo" title="Responsive Lumen demonstration"></iframe>
    </DeviceFrame>
  </div>
  <div class="device-frame-demo-grid">
    <Stack gap="md">
      <div class="device-demo-caption"><h3>iPhone</h3><span>Camera island · image</span></div>
      <div class="device-demo-stage device-demo-stage--phone">
        <DeviceFrame device="iphone" scroll={false}>
          <Image alt="Minimal geometric poster reading Make room for good ideas" height={844} radius="none" src="/device-frame-wallpaper.svg" width={390} />
        </DeviceFrame>
      </div>
    </Stack>
    <Stack gap="md">
      <div class="device-demo-caption"><h3>Google Pixel</h3><span>Porcelain · live HTML</span></div>
      <div class="device-demo-stage device-demo-stage--phone">
        <DeviceFrame device="pixel" tone="light">
          <Stack class="device-demo-pixel" gap="lg">
            <div class="device-demo-clock"><p>Tuesday, October 6</p><span>09<span>:</span>41</span><p><Icon name="sun" /> 24° · A little room to explore</p></div>
            <Card class="device-demo-note"><Stack gap="md"><Badge>Today, at your pace</Badge><h4>Make space<br />for a new idea.</h4><p>A fresh canvas. A clear mind.<br />Something worth making.</p><Button>Start a project <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></Button></Stack></Card>
            <p class="device-demo-hint">Built with real Lumen components</p>
          </Stack>
        </DeviceFrame>
      </div>
    </Stack>
  </div>
  <div class="device-demo-caption"><h3>iMac</h3><span>Silver · live iframe</span></div>
  <div class="device-demo-stage device-demo-stage--computer">
    <DeviceFrame device="imac" tone="light">
      <iframe loading="lazy" sandbox="" src="/device-frame-demo" title="Desktop Lumen demonstration"></iframe>
    </DeviceFrame>
  </div>
  <div class="device-demo-caption"><h3>Landscape tablet</h3><span>Image · custom orientation</span></div>
  <div class="device-demo-stage device-demo-stage--computer">
    <DeviceFrame device="tablet" orientation="landscape"><Image alt="Illustrated mountain landscape" height={600} radius="none" src="/comparison-after.svg" width={960} /></DeviceFrame>
  </div>
  <p>Frames scale to their container. Live HTML and iframe screens reserve space for camera details. Phone images fill the glass beneath the decorative hardware. Generic <code>laptop</code>, <code>desktop</code>, and <code>android</code> presets are also available.</p>
</Stack></Typography>

<style>
  .device-demo-caption { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.5rem 1rem; }
  .device-demo-caption h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .device-demo-caption > span { color: hsl(var(--ink-muted)); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .device-demo-stage { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  .device-demo-stage--computer { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2rem; }
  .device-demo-stage--phone { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; flex: 1; padding: 2rem 1.2rem; }
  .device-demo-stage--phone :global(.ui-device-frame) { max-width: 21rem; }
  .device-frame-demo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: stretch; }
  .device-demo-pixel { position: relative; min-height: 100%; padding: 8% 6% 6%; background: hsl(var(--canvas)); }
  .device-demo-clock { padding-block: 10%; text-align: center; }
  .device-demo-clock > span { display: block; color: hsl(var(--ink)); font-size: clamp(2rem, 18cqi, 5rem); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.08em; line-height: 1.1; }
  .device-demo-clock > span > span { color: hsl(var(--brand)); }
  .device-demo-clock p { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem; margin-block: 1rem; font-size: clamp(0.6rem, 3cqi, 0.8rem); }
  .device-demo-note { border-radius: 0.75rem; background: hsl(var(--surface)); box-shadow: none; }
  .device-demo-note h4 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 7cqi, 2rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.1; }
  .device-demo-note p, .device-demo-hint { font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .device-demo-hint { margin-top: auto; text-align: center; color: hsl(var(--ink-soft)); }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) { .device-frame-demo-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .device-demo-stage { padding: 1.5rem 0.7rem; } }
</style>
